WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.401
Rounding means finding the nearest friendly number.

00:04.851 --> 00:13.132
Let's round four thousand six hundred twenty-eight to the nearest hundred. First find the hundreds on each side.

00:13.132 --> 00:18.086
They are four thousand six hundred and four thousand seven hundred.

00:18.536 --> 00:25.007
Now look at the digit one place to the right of the hundreds. That is the tens digit.

00:25.007 --> 00:25.920
It is a two.

00:26.370 --> 00:32.361
If that digit is zero to four, round down. If it is five to nine, round up.

00:32.811 --> 00:41.588
Two is less than five, so we round down. Four thousand six hundred twenty-eight rounds to four thousand six hundred.
